 and email.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/328/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Barclays US arm confirms credit card data breach</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/27/barclays-us-arm-confirms-credit-card-data-breach/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/27/barclays-us-arm-confirms-credit-card-data-breach/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 15:55:42 +0000</pubDate><description>Barclays Bank Delaware is telling customers that their credit card application details were exposed in a data breach.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/327/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Hackers target security servers at 22 organisations</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/27/hackers-target-security-servers-at-22-organisations/</link><guid>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/2026/11/27/hackers-target-security-servers-at-22-organisations/</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 06:22:08 +0000</pubDate><description>Security researchers say hackers have taken control of security servers at 22 organisations, using known flaws to steal data and disable protections.</description><media:content url="https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/stay-safe-online/assets/media/304/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"><media:credit role="illustrator">AI-generated illustration</media:credit></media:content></item><item><title>Gingko Bioworks data breach claim by cybercriminal group</title><link>https://theknowledgecabinet.github.io/s